        // LegalDocumentsDialog.kt
        "1. Scope & Data Controller (Updated: November 2026)" to "1. Âmbito e responsável pelo tratamento (Atualizado: novembro 2026)",
        "This Privacy Policy explains how Finsay (finsayapp.com, package com.kynigos.oikonomos) collects, uses, processes, stores, and protects your personal and financial tracking data. It is designed to comply with the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR 2016/679), Greek Law 4624/2019, the UK GDPR, applicable United States privacy statutes (including the California CCPA/CPRA, Virginia VCDPA, Colorado CPA, Connecticut CTDPA, and Texas TDPSA), and Google Play Developer Program Policies. Data Controller contact: support@finsayapp.com." to "Esta Política de Privacidade explica como o Finsay (finsayapp.com, pacote com.kynigos.oikonomos) recolhe, trata, guarda e protege os seus dados pessoais e financeiros em conformidade com o RGPD (UE 2016/679), Lei Grega 4624/2019, UK GDPR, leis estaduais dos EUA (CCPA/CPRA, etc.) e políticas do Google Play. Contacto: support@finsayapp.com.",
        "2. Categories of Data Collected & Profile Isolation" to "2. Dados recolhidos e isolamento de perfil",
        "• Account & Authentication Data: Name, email address, unique user identifier (UID), and profile photo obtained via Google Sign-In (Android Credential Manager) or Email/Password through Firebase Authentication.\n• Private Profile Details (Strictly Owner-Only): Optional fields such as phone number, date of birth, occupation, and city are isolated in a private sub-document readable and writable exclusively by your authenticated account—never exposed to other users during ledger-sharing lookups.\n• Financial & Budget Records: Amounts, titles/descriptions, categories, dates, payment sources, selected ledger currency, incomes, monthly budgets, recurring bills, savings goals, and member split/settle-up entries voluntarily logged by you.\n• Shared Household Data: Member nicknames, roles (Creator, Editor, Registar), shared ledger links, and an activity log of ledger edits visible to authorized members of that ledger.\n• Preferences & Local Settings: Language (EL/EN), theme mode, reminder schedules, and local merchant-to-category memory." to "• Conta e autenticação: nome, email, UID e foto via Google Sign-In ou Email/Palavra-passe (Firebase Authentication).\n• Perfil privado (apenas proprietário): telemóvel, data de nascimento, profissão e cidade ficam num documento privado acessível apenas pela sua conta.\n• Registos financeiros: valores, títulos, categorias, datas, moeda, receitas, orçamentos, recorrentes, metas e divisões.\n• Livros partilhados: nomes de membros, papéis (Criador, Editor, Operador), ligações e histórico visível aos membros autorizados.\n• Preferências locais: idioma, tema, lembretes e memória local de lojas.",
        "3. Bank & Wallet Push Notification Reader (Optional, 100% On-Device)" to "3. Leitor de notificações bancárias (Opcional, 100% local)",
        "• Strictly Opt-In: The Bank Notification Auto-Catcher (Android NotificationListenerService) is completely disabled by default. It activates ONLY after you review our in-app Prominent Disclosure and manually grant Notification Access in Android System Settings.\n• Strict Filtering & On-Device Parsing: Finsay filters solely for recognized banking and digital wallet notification packages (ignoring personal messages, chats, emails, and OTP/2FA codes). Merchant name and transaction amount are parsed 100% locally in device memory.\n• Zero Transmission & Explicit Save: Raw notification text is NEVER uploaded to Finsay servers, logged externally, or shared with third parties. Detected alerts create a local draft only; an expense is saved and synced to the cloud ONLY if you actively tap Save/Confirm.\n• No Bank Credentials / No Open Banking: Finsay never collects banking logins, passwords, card numbers, PINs, or PSD2/Open Banking tokens.\n• Revocation: You may disable this feature anytime in App Settings or Android System Settings." to "• Opcional: desativado por predefinição; ativa-se apenas após a sua autorização manual nas definições Android.\n• Filtro rigoroso local: processa apenas notificações de bancos/carteiras suportados (ignora mensagens, SMS, emails e códigos OTP) no dispositivo.\n• Sem transmissão: o texto nunca é enviado nem partilhado; cria apenas um rascunho local guardado com a sua confirmação.\n• Sem credenciais bancárias: nunca recolhe palavras-passe bancárias, cartões, PINs ou tokens PSD2.\n• Revogação: desativável a qualquer momento.",
        "4. Camera, Receipt OCR, AADE/e-Invoicing QR Lookup & Voice Entry" to "4. Câmara, OCR de recibos, QR AADE e voz",
        "• Camera & Photo Picker: Camera access (CAMERA) or the zero-permission Android Photo Picker is used solely when you choose to scan a receipt or QR code. OCR text recognition and barcode decoding run locally on-device via Google ML Kit; receipt images are not uploaded to Finsay servers.\n• Greek AADE / e-Invoicing QR Verification: When you scan a Greek tax/e-invoicing QR code, the app may perform a direct, read-only HTTPS lookup strictly to allowlisted official tax/e-invoicing domains (e.g., aade.gr and certified Greek e-invoicing providers) solely to retrieve merchant name, VAT/AFM, date, and total amount.\n• Voice Expense Entry (RECORD_AUDIO): Used only when you press the microphone button. Speech-to-text relies on Android's native SpeechRecognizer service (subject to your device/Google speech service terms), and the resulting text is parsed locally into a draft expense. Finsay does NOT record, save, or upload audio files." to "• Câmara e galeria: usadas apenas ao ler recibos ou QR. OCR e leitura correm localmente via Google ML Kit; nenhuma imagem é carregada.\n• QR AADE: para códigos fiscais gregos, a app pode consultar apenas domínios oficiais autorizados (ex.: aade.gr) em modo só leitura.\n• Voz (RECORD_AUDIO): usada apenas ao premir o microfone via SpeechRecognizer Android. Nenhum áudio é gravado ou carregado.",
        "5. Biometric App Lock, Local Merchant Memory & Device Features" to "5. Bloqueio biométrico, memória local e dispositivo",
        "• Optional Biometric & PIN App Lock: Fingerprint/Face Unlock uses Android BiometricPrompt handled exclusively by your device's secure OS hardware. Finsay NEVER accesses, collects, stores, or transmits biometric identifiers or templates (compliant with GDPR Art. 9 and US state biometric laws such as BIPA/CUBI). Any optional 4-digit PIN is stored strictly on-device as a salted SHA-256 hash.\n• Smart Merchant Category Memory: Category corrections for merchants/VAT IDs are stored locally on-device (SharedPreferences) solely to improve auto-suggestions.\n• Reminders, Widgets, Quick Tile & App Shortcuts: Local notifications (POST_NOTIFICATIONS, RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED, WAKE_LOCK, VIBRATE) deliver user-configured reminders and bank-draft prompts. Widgets, Quick Settings tiles, and launcher App Shortcuts operate locally." to "• Biometria e PIN: geridos pelo Android BiometricPrompt. O Finsay nunca acede nem guarda dados biométricos; o PIN opcional é guardado localmente em hash SHA-256 com salt.\n• Memória de lojas: correções de categoria ficam apenas no dispositivo.\n• Lembretes, widgets e atalhos: funcionam localmente.",
        "6. Legal Bases (GDPR / UK GDPR), Zero Ads & No Data Selling" to "6. Bases legais (RGPD), zero anúncios e sem venda de dados",
        "• Performance of Contract (Art. 6(1)(b)): Delivering budgeting, multi-currency tracking, analytics, cloud sync, shared ledgers, and data exports.\n• Consent (Art. 6(1)(a)): Mandatory acceptance of these Terms & Privacy Policy (version and timestamp recorded in your private owner-only profile), plus optional bank notification parsing, camera/OCR, microphone voice input, and reminder notifications (withdrawable anytime).\n• Legitimate Interests (Art. 6(1)(f)): Ensuring security, preventing unauthorized access via Firebase Authentication and Zero-Trust Firestore Security Rules, and maintaining service reliability.\n• Zero Ads, No Data Brokers & No Third-Party AI Uploads: Finsay displays no ads, does NOT sell or rent personal data, does NOT share personal data for cross-context behavioral advertising, and does NOT transmit your financial data to third-party cloud LLM/AI services." to "• Execução do contrato (Art. 6.1.b): orçamentos, multimoeda, estatísticas, sync Cloud, partilha e exportações.\n• Consentimento (Art. 6.1.a): aceitação dos Termos/Privacidade e funções opcionais (bancos, OCR, voz, lembretes), revogável sempre.\n• Interesse legítimo (Art. 6.1.f): segurança, regras Zero-Trust Firestore e fiabilidade.\n• Zero anúncios: não mostramos anúncios, não vendemos dados nem os enviamos a IA externa.",
        "7. Cloud Infrastructure, Security & International Transfers" to "7. Infraestrutura Cloud, segurança e transferências",
        "• Storage & Security: Cloud data is hosted on Google Cloud / Firebase Firestore with TLS encryption in transit, AES encryption at rest, Firebase Authentication, and Zero-Trust Security Rules restricting reads/writes to authorized ledger members.\n• International Data Transfers: Because Google Cloud / Firebase operates global infrastructure (including EU and US servers), any transfers outside the EEA or UK are safeguarded by EU Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs), the UK International Data Transfer Addendum, and Google LLC's certification under the EU-US / UK-US Data Privacy Framework.\n• Google Play Services: Finsay Pro purchases are processed exclusively by Google Play Billing (we never see or store payment card details). Native Google Play In-App Updates and In-App Review APIs may run discreetly under Google's Privacy Policy." to "• Segurança: dados alojados no Google Cloud / Firebase Firestore com encriptação TLS em trânsito, AES em repouso e regras Zero-Trust.\n• Transferências internacionais: protegidas por Cláusulas Contratuais-Tipo da UE e EU-US Data Privacy Framework.\n• Google Play: compras Finsay Pro via Google Play Billing; nunca vemos dados de cartões.",
        "8. Data Retention, Exports & Permanent Account Deletion" to "8. Retenção, exportações e eliminação de conta",
        "• Retention: We retain your account and ledger data only for as long as your account remains active or until you delete specific entries or your entire account.\n• Data Portability: You may export your expenses, incomes, balances, and member settle-up summaries to Excel (.xls), PDF (.pdf), or CSV (.csv) locally on-device anytime.\n• Immediate Account Deletion: You may permanently delete your account, private profile, owned ledgers, and cloud/local data directly in the app (Menu (☰) > My Profile > Delete Account) or via https://finsayapp.com/delete-account.html. Residual cloud backups are purged within standard infrastructure cycles (up to 30 days)." to "• Retenção: enquanto a conta estiver ativa ou até eliminar os dados.\n• Portabilidade: exporte para Excel (.xls), PDF (.pdf) ou CSV (.csv) em qualquer momento.\n• Eliminação imediata: em Menu (☰) > Perfil > Eliminar conta ou em https://finsayapp.com/delete-account.html (cópias residuais apagadas até 30 dias).",
        "9. Your Rights (Greece, EU/EEA, UK & United States)" to "9. Os seus direitos (UE/EEE, Reino Unido e EUA)",
        "• Greece, EU/EEA & UK (GDPR / Law 4624/2019 / UK GDPR): You have the right to access, rectify, erase, restrict processing, data portability, object, withdraw consent at any time, and lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority—including the Hellenic Data Protection Authority (HDPA, www.dpa.gr) or the UK ICO.\n• United States (California CCPA/CPRA & State Privacy Laws — VA, CO, CT, UT, TX, etc.): US residents have the right to know/access personal information collected, request deletion, request correction of inaccurate data, obtain a portable copy, and receive non-discriminatory treatment when exercising privacy rights. Finsay DOES NOT \"sell\" personal information and DOES NOT \"share\" personal information for cross-context behavioral advertising. Sensitive personal information is used strictly as necessary to provide requested app features.\n• Exercising Rights: Use in-app tools or email support@finsayapp.com; we verify and respond within 30 days (or the statutory period under applicable law)." to "• UE/EEE e UK (RGPD): direito de acesso, retificação, apagamento, limitação, portabilidade, oposição, retirada de consentimento e reclamação junto da autoridade de controlo (CNPD / HDPA www.dpa.gr).\n• EUA (CCPA/CPRA e leis estaduais): direitos de acesso, eliminação, correção e portabilidade sem discriminação.\n• Exercício: na app ou por email para support@finsayapp.com (resposta em 30 dias).",
        "10. Children's Privacy (COPPA & GDPR Art. 8) & Changes" to "10. Privacidade de menores e alterações",
        "• Children's Privacy: Finsay is not intended for children under 13 years of age (US COPPA) or under 16 years of age (or the applicable digital consent age in your EU/EEA/UK country under GDPR Art. 8). We do not knowingly collect data from children; contact support@finsayapp.com for immediate deletion if you believe a child provided data.\n• Policy Updates: We may update this Privacy Policy to reflect new features or legal requirements. Material changes will be notified in-app or on finsayapp.com." to "• Menores: não se destina a menores de 13 anos (COPPA) ou 16 anos na UE/EEE (ou idade legal aplicável). Contacte support@finsayapp.com para remoção imediata.\n• Atualizações: alterações relevantes serão comunicadas na app ou em finsayapp.com.",
        "1. Acceptance of Terms & Eligibility (Updated: November 2026)" to "1. Aceitação e elegibilidade (Atualizado: novembro 2026)",
        "By downloading, installing, registering for, or using Finsay (finsayapp.com), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and our Privacy Policy. You must be at least 16 years old in the EU/EEA/UK (or the applicable legal digital consent age in your jurisdiction) and at least 13 years old in the United States (or have verifiable parental consent where required) to use Finsay. If you do not agree, do not use the application." to "Ao transferir ou usar o Finsay (finsayapp.com), aceita estes Termos de Serviço e a Política de Privacidade. Deve ter pelo menos 16 anos na UE/EEE/UK (ou idade legal local) e 13 anos nos EUA. Caso contrário, não utilize a aplicação.",
        "2. Service Description & Strict Financial / Tax Advice Disclaimer" to "2. Descrição do serviço e exclusão de aconselhamento",
        "Finsay is an informational personal and household expense, income, budget, multi-currency, and split-tracking tool. Finsay DOES NOT provide financial, investment, banking, accounting, legal, or tax advice, nor does it execute payments, currency conversions, or money transfers. Displayed currencies are purely organizational labels; Finsay does not perform regulated foreign-exchange brokerage. You remain solely responsible for verifying all figures, tax obligations, and financial decisions." to "O Finsay é uma ferramenta informativa para despesas, receitas, orçamentos e divisões. Não presta aconselhamento financeiro, fiscal ou jurídico nem executa pagamentos ou câmbios. É da sua responsabilidade verificar todos os valores.",
        "3. Bank Notification Reader Disclaimer (No Open Banking / PSD2)" to "3. Aviso sobre leitor bancário (Sem Open Banking / PSD2)",
        "• Independent Local Utility: The optional Bank Notification Auto-Catcher reads Android payment notifications solely on-device after your explicit system authorization. Finsay is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to any bank, card issuer, or payment institution, and does NOT operate as a PSD2 / Open Banking Account Information Service Provider (AISP) or Payment Initiation Service Provider (PISP).\n• Best-Effort Accuracy: Because banks frequently change notification wording and Android battery/OEM policies may delay or restrict background delivery, Finsay cannot guarantee that every card payment will be detected or parsed with 100% accuracy. You must review and confirm every draft before saving and rely on official bank statements for authoritative records." to "• Utilitário local independente: lê notificações apenas localmente após a sua autorização. O Finsay não tem vínculo bancário nem opera como serviço PSD2 / Open Banking.\n• Verificação necessária: confirme sempre cada rascunho e consulte extratos bancários oficiais.",
        "4. Receipt OCR, AADE / e-Invoicing QR Lookup & Voice Entry" to "4. OCR de recibos, QR AADE e entrada por voz",
        "Optical character recognition (OCR), QR receipt lookups (including direct read-only queries to allowlisted Greek tax/e-invoicing portals such as AADE), and voice-to-text parsing are automated convenience features that may occasionally misread text, speech, dates, or totals. Finsay is not affiliated with AADE or any e-invoicing provider. You are solely responsible for checking and correcting auto-filled values against original receipts before saving." to "OCR, leitura QR AADE e voz são funções automáticas sujeitas a erros ocasionais. O Finsay não é afiliado à AADE. Verifique sempre os valores antes de guardar.",
        "5. Shared Households, Member Roles & Third-Party Consent" to "5. Livros partilhados, papéis e consentimento de terceiros",
        "When creating or participating in a shared ledger (Creator, Editor, Registar), you acknowledge that financial entries, split balances, and ledger activity logs are visible to all authorized members of that ledger according to their roles. You represent and warrant that you have obtained appropriate consent before entering another individual's personal information or inviting them to a shared ledger, and you are responsible for managing member access in ledgers you control." to "Ao participar num livro partilhado (Criador, Editor, Operador), aceita que movimentos, saldos e histórico sejam visíveis aos membros autorizados e garante ter o consentimento das pessoas convidadas.",
        "6. Account Security, Optional App Lock & Data Exports" to "6. Segurança da conta, bloqueio e exportações",
        "• Credentials & Local App Lock: You are responsible for safeguarding your sign-in credentials and device. Optional Biometric/PIN App Lock is a local convenience safeguard; if you forget your PIN or lose device biometric access, recovery may require re-authentication or reinstalling the app.\n• Exported Files: When you export reports (Excel, PDF, CSV) and share them via third-party apps (email, messaging, cloud drives), those exported copies leave Finsay's control and their confidentiality becomes your sole responsibility." to "• Credenciais e bloqueio: proteja as suas credenciais e dispositivo. Se esquecer o PIN local, poderá ser necessário voltar a entrar ou reinstalar.\n• Ficheiros exportados: a confidencialidade de relatórios (Excel, PDF, CSV) partilhados fora da app é da sua responsabilidade.",
        "7. Finsay Pro Subscriptions, Renewals & Refunds (Google Play)" to "7. Subscrições Finsay Pro, renovações e reembolsos",
        "• Billing & Auto-Renewal: Certain advanced features (such as Bank Notification Auto-Catcher, multiple ledgers, and unlimited members) require a Finsay Pro subscription or lifetime purchase processed exclusively via Google Play Billing. Recurring subscriptions automatically renew unless cancelled in Google Play settings before the end of the current billing period.\n• Refunds & Consumer Rights: Pricing, cancellations, and refund requests are governed by Google Play's billing policies and applicable mandatory consumer laws in your jurisdiction (including statutory EU/UK withdrawal rights where applicable and US consumer statutes)." to "• Faturação: funções avançadas requerem Finsay Pro via Google Play Billing. As subscrições renovam automaticamente salvo cancelamento no Google Play.\n• Reembolsos: regidos pelo Google Play e pelas leis obrigatórias de defesa do consumidor.",
        "8. Acceptable Use & Intellectual Property" to "8. Uso aceitável e propriedade intelectual",
        "You agree not to misuse Finsay, bypass authentication or security rules, attempt unauthorized access to other users' data, reverse-engineer or copy proprietary components except as permitted by mandatory law, or use the app for fraudulent or unlawful purposes. All Finsay trademarks, branding, design, and software remain the intellectual property of Finsay and its creators." to "Concorda em não usar o Finsay indevidamente, contornar a segurança, aceder sem autorização a dados de terceiros ou copiar o software. Marcas, design e código pertencem ao Finsay.",
        "9. Disclaimer of Warranties & Limitation of Liability" to "9. Exclusão de garantias e limitação de responsabilidade",
        "To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, Finsay is provided \"AS IS\" and \"AS AVAILABLE\" without warranties of uninterrupted operation or error-free parsing. To the maximum extent permitted by law, Finsay and its developers shall not be liable for indirect, incidental, special, punitive, or consequential damages, missed bill reminders, unparsed notifications, or loss of profits/data; aggregate liability shall not exceed the total amount paid by you for Finsay Pro during the twelve (12) months preceding the claim.\n• Statutory Carve-Out (EU/UK/US): Nothing in these Terms excludes or limits liability that cannot legally be excluded under mandatory law (including gross negligence, willful misconduct, fraud, or mandatory statutory consumer rights in the EU/EEA, UK, or US states)." to "Na máxima extensão legal, o Finsay é fornecido \"TAL COMO ESTÁ\" sem garantias de funcionamento ininterrupto. A responsabilidade total limita-se ao valor pago pelo Finsay Pro nos últimos 12 meses, sem prejuízo dos direitos imperativos do consumidor (UE/EEE, UK, EUA).",
        "10. Termination, Changes, Governing Law & International Consumer Rights" to "10. Cessação, alterações e lei aplicável",
        "• Termination: You may terminate your account anytime via Menu (☰) > My Profile > Delete Account. We may suspend accounts that materially violate these Terms or threaten platform security.\n• Governing Law & Consumer Carve-Out: These Terms are governed by the laws of the Hellenic Republic (Greece) and applicable European Union law, with disputes submitted to the courts of Athens, Greece. However, if you are a consumer residing in the EU/EEA, the UK, or the United States, nothing in these Terms deprives you of the mandatory consumer protection laws or statutory forum rights of your country or state of residence.\n• Contact: support@finsayapp.com." to "• Cessação: pode encerrar a conta em Menu (☰) > Perfil > Eliminar conta.\n• Lei aplicável: lei grega e da União Europeia (tribunais de Atenas), sem prejuízo dos direitos imperativos de defesa do consumidor no seu país de residência.\n• Contacto: support@finsayapp.com."
    )
}
